{"aliases":["https://huggingface.co/datasets/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench"],"authors":[],"details":{"availability":"Public benchmark runtime, task CSVs, MemGUI-Eval evaluator and trajectory viewer; the runtime image is pulled prebuilt and evaluation needs API access to the judge models.","benchmark_protocol":{"actions":["MobileWorld JSON actions"],"counts":[{"basis":"computed","evidence_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/3fb01b6cc0d13e287c67f488c76f449df7d65558/data/memgui-tasks-all.csv","population":"data/memgui-tasks-all.csv at 3fb01b6 (full benchmark)","qualifier":"exact","unit":"tasks","value":128},{"basis":"computed","evidence_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/3fb01b6cc0d13e287c67f488c76f449df7d65558/data/memgui-tasks-40.csv","population":"data/memgui-tasks-40.csv at 3fb01b6 (quick-test subset)","qualifier":"exact","unit":"tasks","value":40},{"basis":"computed","evidence_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/3fb01b6cc0d13e287c67f488c76f449df7d65558/data/memgui-tasks-all.csv","population":"data/memgui-tasks-all.csv at 3fb01b6 (full benchmark)","qualifier":"exact","unit":"applications","value":26},{"basis":"computed","evidence_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/3fb01b6cc0d13e287c67f488c76f449df7d65558/data/memgui-tasks-all.csv","population":"data/memgui-tasks-all.csv at 3fb01b6 (full benchmark)","qualifier":"exact","unit":"tasks marked as requiring UI memory","value":115}],"evaluation":"MemGUI-Eval: an LLM step-description model and a final-decision model judge each trajectory; reported metrics are pass@K, information retrieval rate (IRR), failure recovery rate (FRR), memory task performance ratio (MTPR), step ratio, time per step and cost per step.","evidence_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/3fb01b6cc0d13e287c67f488c76f449df7d65558/README.md","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/3fb01b6cc0d13e287c67f488c76f449df7d65558/data/memgui-tasks-all.csv","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/3fb01b6cc0d13e287c67f488c76f449df7d65558/data/memgui-tasks-40.csv","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/3fb01b6cc0d13e287c67f488c76f449df7d65558/memgui_eval/evaluator.py"],"focus":["memory-intensive mobile GUI tasks","cross-app long-horizon tasks"],"notes":"Counts come from the pinned CSV files and match the README badges (128 tasks, 26 apps, 89.8% memory-intensive). The full set has 48, 42 and 38 tasks at difficulty levels 1, 2 and 3, and its golden steps average about 36. The 40-task file is a subset of the 128 tasks, so the two counts are not summed. Leaderboard settings fix the judge models; debugging runs may use others.","observations":["screenshots"],"setting":"interactive"},"leaderboard_url":"https://lgy0404.github.io/MemGUI-Bench/leaderboard.html","license_review":{"data":{"evidence_urls":["https://huggingface.co/datasets/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/raw/217713ee891b227b1f297c3a59dd1798e9d4a09b/README.md"],"reason":"The Hub card for the task CSV files (the alias lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench) declares mit; it covers the task definitions, not app content."}},"repository_revision":"3fb01b6cc0d13e287c67f488c76f449df7d65558"},"environments":["android"],"evidence":[{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-19T07:05:14Z","role":"primary","sha256":"fab1bf3b766c2e59e46515dd60cf71b040986690b169bfcc0d35c6e9bc0f58fb","supports":["name","kind","summary","environments","topics","scope","notes","relations","details.leaderboard_url"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/3fb01b6cc0d13e287c67f488c76f449df7d65558/README.md"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-19T07:05:17Z","role":"primary","sha256":"5ea1ee28f93335f167bc25b3db56248dc01cfc066ea8eceaddaf361545fc03ab","supports":["identity","release_status","details.repository_revision","details.availability","notes"],"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/git/trees/3fb01b6cc0d13e287c67f488c76f449df7d65558?recursive=1"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-19T07:05:18Z","role":"primary","sha256":"28d862beb94250e5630b6f7cc2a50369f4fb533fe7cf780991c1f4f73790be07","supports":["summary","details.benchmark_protocol"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/3fb01b6cc0d13e287c67f488c76f449df7d65558/data/memgui-tasks-all.csv"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-19T07:05:18Z","role":"primary","sha256":"138b8371bf1880df837b99d596e5a86679a9fe0ce0be33da69846e4ea2b44169","supports":["details.benchmark_protocol"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/3fb01b6cc0d13e287c67f488c76f449df7d65558/data/memgui-tasks-40.csv"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-19T07:05:18Z","role":"primary","sha256":"c8e9270c39852e17fa1b2d34bf3ca630375f68a1d817474e6a446e53d9490c1f","supports":["details.benchmark_protocol","notes"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/3fb01b6cc0d13e287c67f488c76f449df7d65558/memgui_eval/evaluator.py"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-19T07:05:18Z","role":"primary","sha256":"4fcd9de2604362b40f3529af286e34882e01bd4cb26dbedc9934c09a3f6ee827","supports":["licenses.code"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/3fb01b6cc0d13e287c67f488c76f449df7d65558/LICENSE"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-19T07:05:19Z","role":"primary","sha256":"1c291cb5096e2cf98e945456b1acb66d7b1bebd3d950c9d043b34ef75dd660b5","supports":["aliases","notes","licenses.data"],"url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/raw/217713ee891b227b1f297c3a59dd1798e9d4a09b/README.md"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-19T07:05:19Z","role":"primary","sha256":"d44183bab1958372904dd52e19efdb4d8bb277a896fe24a9954b65e2fc926db1","supports":["aliases","notes"],"url":"https://huggingface.co/api/datasets/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/revision/217713ee891b227b1f297c3a59dd1798e9d4a09b"},{"method":"license_header","retrieved_at":"2026-10-19T07:06:23Z","role":"primary","sha256":"4fcd9de2604362b40f3529af286e34882e01bd4cb26dbedc9934c09a3f6ee827","supports":["licenses.code"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/HEAD/LICENSE"}],"id":"github:lgy0404/memgui-bench","identifiers":{},"kind":"benchmark","last_verified_at":"2026-10-19T07:05:14Z","licenses":{"code":{"basis":"repository LICENSE header; not a weights/data license","declared":"MIT","retrieved_at":"2026-10-19T07:06:23Z","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/HEAD/LICENSE"},"data":{"basis":"The Hub card for the task CSV files (the alias lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench) declares mit; it covers the task definitions, not app content.","declared":"mit","retrieved_at":"2026-10-19T07:05:19Z","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/raw/217713ee891b227b1f297c3a59dd1798e9d4a09b/README.md"},"document":null,"weights":null},"links":[{"rel":"primary","url":"https://github.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench"}],"name":"MemGUI-Bench","notes":"Official benchmark code for the MemGUI-Bench paper (ACM MM 2026 per the README). The mg CLI pulls a prebuilt Docker runtime with the Android emulator and the MemGUI AVD snapshot, launches parallel backend containers on a Linux host with KVM, runs agents through MobileWorld's agent interface (src/mobile_world) and writes MobileWorld-format trajectories with screenshots. MemGUI-Eval (memgui_eval/) describes each step with a multimodal model and makes a final decision with a second model; the leaderboard uses Gemini 2.5 Flash and Gemini 2.5 Pro for these roles. Each task CSV row gives the app(s), difficulty, whether UI memory is required and golden steps; the default step budget is int(golden_steps * 2.5 + 1). The Hugging Face dataset lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench holds the same two task CSV files (byte-identical at revisions 217713e and 3fb01b6), so it is recorded as an alias. Agent results in the README and leaderboard were not reproduced.","published_at":null,"relations":[{"evidence_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/3fb01b6cc0d13e287c67f488c76f449df7d65558/README.md","target_id":"github:tongyi-mai/mobileworld","type":"uses"},{"evidence_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench/3fb01b6cc0d13e287c67f488c76f449df7d65558/README.md","target_id":"arxiv:2602.06075","type":"documented_by"}],"review_status":"curated","scope":"core","summary":"Memory-centric Android benchmark of 128 tasks across 26 apps, run in Dockerized emulators on a MobileWorld-style runtime and judged by MemGUI-Eval, an LLM evaluator reporting pass@k and memory metrics.","task_classes":["R01.11.01.01"],"topics":["evaluation","memory","long-horizon","cross-app"],"updated_at":null,"url":"https://github.com/lgy0404/MemGUI-Bench"}
